Wannier90 4.0.2 named the MPI related libraries with the suffix _mpi, something which 
has been ditched in Wannier90 4.0.3. Given we are doing multiple builds, that might 
be not the best solution for us. This patch simple adds the suffix _mpi again, which
in my opinion is a better way of doing it
Author: J. Saßmannshausen (Imperial College London/UK)
diff --git a/wannier90-4.0.3.orig/CMakeLists.txt b/wannier90-4.0.3/CMakeLists.txt
index 72c4644..68abe07 100644
--- a/wannier90-4.0.3.orig/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/wannier90-4.0.3/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -33,6 +33,9 @@ option(WANNIER90_TEST "Wannier90: Build test-suite" ${PROJECT_IS_TOP_LEVEL})
 
 # the library name is the same for MPI and serial builds
 set(WANNIER90_LIBRARY_NAME wannier90)
+if (WANNIER90_MPI)
+        set(WANNIER90_LIBRARY_NAME wannier90_mpi)
+endif ()
 
